    "parent_id": "bd3de297-69c8-4ef0-ad61-1b7bbd0f811c",
    "content": "- Maximum outperformance (125%+ ARR target): 200% target payout cap. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
